===Etymology===
After the handshapes, as a {{calque|en|ja|じゃんけんぽん|tr=jankenpon|nocap=1}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|games}} {{def|A popular children's [[game]] using three [[hand]] [[sign]]s representing rock, paper and scissors, frequently used as a [[tiebreaker]].}}
#: {{syn|en|paper scissors stone|scissors paper rock|scissors paper stone|janken|roshambo|rochambeau|row-sham-bow|roe-sham-boe}}
# {{def|By extension, any situation where [[strategy|strategies]] are not [[transitive]], meaning each strategy is strong against some strategies and weak against others in a loop such that there is no universally best option.}}

